@model IEnumerable<MonitoringAndEvaluationPlatform.Controllers.RequestEmployeesController.EmployeeRow>
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.Localization
@inject IViewLocalizer Localizer

@{
    ViewData["Title"] = Localizer["RequestEmployees"];
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_DashboardHomeLayout.cshtml";
}

<div class="container-fluid py-4">
    <div class="dashboard-header mb-4">
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center flex-wrap gap-2">
            <div>
                <h1 class="display-5 mb-2">
                    <i class="fas fa-address-book me-3"></i>@Localizer["RequestEmployees"]
                </h1>
                <p class="text-muted mb-0">@Localizer["RequestEmployeesHint"]</p>
            </div>
            <a asp-action="Create" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
                <i class="fas fa-user-plus me-2"></i>@Localizer["NewEmployee"]
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>

    @if (TempData["SuccessMessage"] != null)
    {
        <div class="alert alert-success alert-dismissible fade show" role="alert">
            <i class="fas fa-check-circle me-2"></i>@TempData["SuccessMessage"]
            <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert" aria-label="Close"></button>
        </div>
    }

    <div class="card">
        <div class="table-responsive">
            <table class="table table-hover align-middle mb-0">
                <thead class="table-light">
                    <tr>
                        <th>@Localizer["Name"]</th>
                        <th>@Localizer["JobTitle"]</th>
                        <th>@Localizer["PhoneNumber"]</th>
                        <th>@Localizer["Email"]</th>
                        <th>@Localizer["Requests"]</th>
                        <th class="text-end">@Localizer["Actions"]</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    @if (!Model.Any())
                    {
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="6" class="text-center text-muted py-4">
                                <i class="fas fa-address-book fa-2x d-block mb-2"></i>
                                @Localizer["NoEmployeesYet"]
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        @foreach (var row in Model)
                        {
                            <tr>
                                <td><strong>@row.Employee.Name</strong></td>
                                <td>@(row.Employee.JobTitle ?? "-")</td>
                                <td dir="ltr">@(row.Employee.PhoneNumber ?? "-")</td>
                                <td dir="ltr">@(row.Employee.Email ?? "-")</td>
                                <td>
                                    @if (row.RequestCount > 0)
                                    {
                                        <a asp-controller="Requests" asp-action="Index" asp-route-employeeId="@row.Employee.Id"
                                           class="badge bg-info text-decoration-none">@row.RequestCount</a>
                                    }
                                    else
                                    {
                                        <span class="text-muted">0</span>
                                    }
                                </td>
                                <td class="text-end text-nowrap">
                                    <a asp-action="Edit" asp-route-id="@row.Employee.Id" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">
                                        <i class="fas fa-edit"></i>
                                    </a>
                                    <form asp-action="Delete" asp-route-id="@row.Employee.Id" method="post" class="d-inline"
                                          onsubmit="return confirm('@Localizer["ConfirmDeleteEmployee"]');">
                                        @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
                                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger">
                                            <i class="fas fa-trash"></i>
                                        </button>
                                    </form>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        }
                    }
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
